gnYLbPeXjj20Z_-GjXa5NxemsKcckUQzmwJpaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4MBKDY4h4Q4k0LhP4Zc6HLvQM4Wte0UH7mb0nOJk6NPg&oe=6A0C600A"}, "display_name": "PICKABOOM", "keywords": ["survival", "horror", "free", "shooting", "mining"], "long_description": "**MINE ORES. SHOOT ALIENS.**                                                                                                                                                                           \n{1992847338010690}\n\nENTER DANGEROUS CAVES, MINE VALUABLE MINERALS, AND FIGHT OFF ALIEN CREATURES TO SURVIVE.\n\n**EXPLORE MASSIVE CAVES.**\n{1277545327906163}\n\nNAVIGATE VAST UNDERGROUND ENVIRONMENTS FILLED WITH RESOURCES, HIDDEN PATHS, AND CONSTANT DANGER.\n\n**CUSTOMIZE YOUR AVATAR**\n{1000141166048660}\nCUSTOMIZE YOUR MINER WITH UNIQUE DNA BUILDS. PLACE THE ACCESSORIES WHEREVER YOU WANT!\n\n**FIGHT BOSSES.** \n{26625863637042260}\nCLAIM TREASURE. TAKE DOWN POWERFUL BOSSES DEEP UNDERGROUND AND CLAIM RARE REWARDS.\n\n**TECH TREE.**\n{1342354037946372}\nUPGRADE YOUR GEAR AND ABILITIES TO BECOME STRONGER WITH EVERY RUN.\n\n**PLAY TOGETHER.**\n{1761786788533442}\nTEAM UP WITH UP TO 11 PLAYERS AND SURVIVE THE MINES.\n\n**WELCOME TO THE MINES.**\n{1363649142273658}\nENTER A PORTAL, GO DEEPER, AND SURVIVE THE RUN.\n\n**UPDATES EVERY WEDNESDAY.**\n\nJOIN THE DISCORD \ud83d\udc49 https://discord.com/invite/pickaboom\n\n**WELCOME, MINER. CONGRATULATIONS ON JOINING PICKABOOM!** IF YOU\u2019RE A HARD WORKER, A GOOD SHOT AND A RELIABLE TEAM PLAYER, YOU SHOULD HAVE RESPECTABLE ODDS OF SURVIVAL.\n\n\n", "short_description": "PICKABOOM IS A MULTIPLAYER MINER SHOOTER FEATURING SPACE MINERS, MASSIVE ENVIRONMENTS, AND ENDLESS HORDES OF ALIEN MONSTERS. EXPLORE CAVE SYSTEMS, MINE FOR MINERALS, AND WORK TOGETHER TO SURVIVE!\n\nJOIN THE DISCORD \ud83d\udc49 [https://discord.com/invite/pickaboom](https://discord.com/invite/pickaboom)"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pickaboomvr.com/policy-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "PIGIAMA KASAMA", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.pickaboomvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "26645039038478488"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_966610739588377_6671190512333458133_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VvwMIPIdFYAQ7kNvwGTd6_g&_nc_oc=AdpdcwZtsPJq5Sh-cZgq_9c2oaBKT3g-I7SEiuniPOuwcL2CqTdT-LbMwxf1x6ESRLU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7SWPbRBXKM5PZfncJgzeusJpwuoOnJUM_0Ku2NlRITSQ&oe=6A0C7FE7"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "PICKABOOM", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Shooter", "id": "3744040075834813"}, {"topic_name": "Platformer", "id": "528142316460358"}, {"topic_name": "Action", "id": "459781504968480"}, {"topic_name": "Hangout", "id": "1023770785722696"}, {"topic_name": "Survival", "id": "644354873106712"}], "release_date": 1761836460, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "